        "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/QUBelfast/status/2013905475817927147",
        "text": "Congratulations to Professor Olwen Purdue who has been elected President of the International Federation for Public History.  \n\nProfessor Purdue, who is the Director of the Centre for Public History at Queen's, is an internationally recognised public historian who works closely with cultural organisations and communities at local and global levels.  \n\nYou can find out more about Professor Purdue's work and her new appointment here: https://t.co/WmSnawwFDO \n\n#LoveQUB | #PublicHistory | #History | @HAPPatQUB",
